9
00:00:46.154 --> 00:00:46.500
In these two

10
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.231
verses, Lord Krishna

11
00:00:48.231 --> 00:00:51.231
answers a crucial question –

12
00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:54.385
who truly is the doer of action?

13
00:00:54.385 --> 00:00:55.654
For any person,

14
00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:57.308
gaining this knowledge is essential

15
00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:58.654
to be free from

16
00:00:58.654 --> 00:01:01.538
the results of their actions.

17
00:01:01.538 --> 00:01:04.615
Thus, Lord Krishna here explains

18
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
this profound subject.

19
00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:13.885
In this verse, Lord Krishna clarifies

20
00:01:13.885 --> 00:01:14.692
the soul's role

21
00:01:14.692 --> 00:01:16.462
in relation to action

22
00:01:16.462 --> 00:01:19.462
and material nature,

23
00:01:19.577 --> 00:01:20.269
and sheds light

24
00:01:20.269 --> 00:01:23.615
on the concept of the doer of action.

25
00:01:24.269 --> 00:01:27.577
In chapter five, verse thirteen, Lord Krishna

26
00:01:27.615 --> 00:01:28.423
describes

27
00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:31.038
the state of one who,

28
00:01:31.038 --> 00:01:34.231
while living in this "city of nine gates,"

29
00:01:34.615 --> 00:01:35.808
mentally

30
00:01:35.808 --> 00:01:38.615
renounces all actions.

31
00:01:38.615 --> 00:01:43.231
These nine gates are - two eyes, two nostrils,

32
00:01:43.231 --> 00:01:47.269
two ears, mouth, anus, and genitals.

33
00:01:47.846 --> 00:01:50.423
It is through these nine gates

34
00:01:50.423 --> 00:01:51.808
that our body maintains contact

35
00:01:51.808 --> 00:01:54.538
with the outer world.

36
00:01:54.538 --> 00:01:57.346
This verse aims to explain

37
00:01:57.346 --> 00:02:00.346
who is the real doer of actions.

38
00:02:00.385 --> 00:02:04.038
Is it you or the soul? Lord Krishna explains

39
00:02:04.308 --> 00:02:04.654
that

40
00:02:04.654 --> 00:02:07.577
one who controls their nature

41
00:02:07.577 --> 00:02:10.423
and mentally renounces the sense

42
00:02:10.423 --> 00:02:12.115
of being the doer,

43
00:02:12.115 --> 00:02:13.115
can

44
00:02:13.115 --> 00:02:15.654
live happily within their body,

45
00:02:15.654 --> 00:02:19.038
free from the bondage of their actions.

46
00:02:19.615 --> 00:02:20.654
This person

47
00:02:20.654 --> 00:02:23.692
understands that though the body performs actions,

48
00:02:24.115 --> 00:02:25.385
but the soul

49
00:02:25.385 --> 00:02:27.308
remains uninvolved in these actions.

50
00:02:28.346 --> 00:02:29.423
In the next verse 5.14,

51
00:02:29.423 --> 00:02:31.538
Lord Krishna expands

52
00:02:31.538 --> 00:02:33.692
this concept further,

53
00:02:33.692 --> 00:02:36.269
where he clarifies that the embodied

54
00:02:36.269 --> 00:02:39.308
soul, though master of the body,

55
00:02:39.615 --> 00:02:42.615
neither creates activities,

56
00:02:42.846 --> 00:02:43.423
nor

57
00:02:43.423 --> 00:02:44.423
induces others

58
00:02:44.423 --> 00:02:46.462
to act,

59
00:02:46.462 --> 00:02:47.154
nor

60
00:02:47.154 --> 00:02:50.154
produces the results of action.

61
00:02:50.385 --> 00:02:54.192
If the soul is not the cause of actions, then who is?

62
00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.154
It is the

63
00:02:56.154 --> 00:02:59.423
person's "nature." It is nature

64
00:02:59.731 --> 00:03:02.731
that drives the body's actions,

65
00:03:02.885 --> 00:03:04.346
not the soul.

66
00:03:04.346 --> 00:03:06.885
But what exactly

67
00:03:06.885 --> 00:03:09.269
is this nature?

68
00:03:09.269 --> 00:03:12.269
Nature is the result of one's past actions.

69
00:03:12.385 --> 00:03:14.615
Due to these past actions, the person

70
00:03:14.615 --> 00:03:17.269
is influenced by a specific combination

71
00:03:17.269 --> 00:03:18.462
of the three modes

72
00:03:18.462 --> 00:03:20.115
of material nature,

73
00:03:20.115 --> 00:03:22.885
which compels that person to act

74
00:03:22.885 --> 00:03:25.885
in certain specific ways.

75
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.769
However, this does not mean

76
00:03:28.769 --> 00:03:31.846
that the soul has no responsibility

77
00:03:32.154 --> 00:03:35.154
for whatever happens through this body.

78
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.769
This will be explained

79
00:03:36.769 --> 00:03:39.462
in later verses.

80
00:03:39.462 --> 00:03:42.231
At this stage, it's important to understand

81
00:03:42.231 --> 00:03:45.231
that the soul is not the 'only' doer

82
00:03:45.538 --> 00:03:49.038
and one needs to be free from this illusion.

83
00:03:54.077 --> 00:03:57.077
Do you feel that you

84
00:03:57.385 --> 00:04:01.615
alone are the doer of your actions,

85
00:04:03.038 --> 00:04:05.231
that every decision taken

86
00:04:05.231 --> 00:04:07.538
is completely

87
00:04:07.538 --> 00:04:10.538
under your control?

88
00:04:11.308 --> 00:04:13.462
Is it due to this thinking

89
00:04:13.462 --> 00:04:16.154
that you hold yourself responsible

90
00:04:16.154 --> 00:04:18.846
for every success or failure,

91
00:04:18.846 --> 00:04:21.846
every joy or sorrow?

92
00:04:22.077 --> 00:04:25.077
Such thinking is an illusion.

93
00:04:26.808 --> 00:04:28.000
Due to this sense

94
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.885
of considering yourself the doer,

95
00:04:30.885 --> 00:04:34.154
you remain bound in the endless cycle of actions.

96
00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:37.462
For this reason, you consider yourself

97
00:04:37.462 --> 00:04:40.346
responsible for every event

98
00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:43.231
and its consequences.

99
00:04:43.231 --> 00:04:47.000
Your body is a city with nine gates,

100
00:04:47.808 --> 00:04:52.308
through which you, meaning, the soul,

101
00:04:53.231 --> 00:04:56.231
connect with the outer world.

102
00:04:56.615 --> 00:04:58.038
The soul merely

103
00:04:58.038 --> 00:05:00.654
dwells in this body,

104
00:05:00.654 --> 00:05:03.654
sees, experiences too,

105
00:05:04.462 --> 00:05:07.192
but does not actually

106
00:05:07.192 --> 00:05:10.192
engage in action,

107
00:05:10.538 --> 00:05:13.346
remains untouched

108
00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:15.346
by all material acts.

109
00:05:15.346 --> 00:05:17.308
The body's actions

110
00:05:17.308 --> 00:05:19.846
are driven by your own nature.

111
00:05:21.269 --> 00:05:22.538
The combination

112
00:05:22.538 --> 00:05:26.231
of nature and disposition is the force,

113
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.000
that formed by

114
00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.846
your own past actions,

115
00:05:31.846 --> 00:05:33.654
motivates your body

116
00:05:33.654 --> 00:05:36.692
to perform new actions,

117
00:05:37.654 --> 00:05:40.154
not the soul.

118
00:05:40.154 --> 00:05:43.154
When you understand this truth,

119
00:05:43.308 --> 00:05:46.308
then you can detach yourself

120
00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.154
from the fruits of your actions.

121
00:05:49.154 --> 00:05:51.192
In such a state, there's no need

122
00:05:51.192 --> 00:05:52.692
to bear the burden of

123
00:05:52.692 --> 00:05:55.692
success or failure,

124
00:05:55.846 --> 00:05:58.731
because you understand

125
00:05:58.731 --> 00:06:02.692
that these are not really in your control.

126
00:06:04.192 --> 00:06:07.192
If anything is in your control,

127
00:06:08.423 --> 00:06:11.423
it is the development of your consciousness.

128
00:06:12.462 --> 00:06:15.462
Reflect upon it.

129
00:06:18.808 --> 00:06:19.538
Everyone wants

130
00:06:19.538 --> 00:06:22.538
happiness for their loved ones at home,

131
00:06:22.577 --> 00:06:25.654
for peace to prevail

132
00:06:26.115 --> 00:06:29.115
or for family goals to be achieved.

133
00:06:29.615 --> 00:06:33.308
But do you consider yourself

134
00:06:33.346 --> 00:06:36.346
solely responsible for every event

135
00:06:37.423 --> 00:06:40.423
in your family or social life?

136
00:06:40.462 --> 00:06:42.462
Do you feel

137
00:06:42.462 --> 00:06:45.308
that if you work harder,

138
00:06:45.308 --> 00:06:46.000
do more,

139
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.423
or control

140
00:06:47.423 --> 00:06:49.846
the situation better,

141
00:06:49.846 --> 00:06:52.846
you can make everyone at home happy?

142
00:06:52.885 --> 00:06:54.577
Taking all responsibility

143
00:06:54.577 --> 00:06:56.346
only upon yourself

144
00:06:56.346 --> 00:06:58.846
becomes a heavy burden.

145
00:06:58.846 --> 00:07:01.808
This very thought of considering

146
00:07:01.808 --> 00:07:06.462
yourself solely responsible becomes the cause of tension,

147
00:07:06.846 --> 00:07:10.269
disappointment and conflict at home or in society.

148
00:07:11.115 --> 00:07:13.346
At home or in society, each

149
00:07:13.346 --> 00:07:17.385
person's actions, mutual relationships and events

150
00:07:17.885 --> 00:07:20.885
are influenced by many factors

151
00:07:21.231 --> 00:07:24.231
beyond their control.

152
00:07:26.038 --> 00:07:28.846
Every person's nature,

153
00:07:28.846 --> 00:07:32.577
their past actions, and the modes of nature

154
00:07:33.192 --> 00:07:35.115
are the forces

155
00:07:35.115 --> 00:07:38.115
that guide their behavior.

156
00:07:39.231 --> 00:07:41.654
Do not try to control

157
00:07:41.654 --> 00:07:43.808
these causes.

158
00:07:43.808 --> 00:07:47.115
Just understand them and

159
00:07:47.423 --> 00:07:49.154
fulfill your duty with love

160
00:07:49.154 --> 00:07:52.154
and detachment.

161
00:07:52.231 --> 00:07:53.308
You must

162
00:07:54.346 --> 00:07:55.769
certainly

163
00:07:55.769 --> 00:07:58.846
make your best effort

164
00:07:58.885 --> 00:08:01.885
to cooperate, guide and contribute.

165
00:08:02.038 --> 00:08:04.269
Understanding

166
00:08:04.269 --> 00:08:07.269
that not everything depends on you.

167
00:08:08.423 --> 00:08:11.423
When not everything depends on you,

168
00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.538
when not everything is under your control,

169
00:08:15.462 --> 00:08:18.462
why carry any kind of

170
00:08:20.115 --> 00:08:21.692
worry or burden?

171
00:08:21.692 --> 00:08:23.692
Living in the present,

172
00:08:23.692 --> 00:08:27.154
think only about

173
00:08:27.154 --> 00:08:30.154
your positive contribution.

174
00:08:34.423 --> 00:08:37.846
In your professional work,

175
00:08:37.846 --> 00:08:39.462
as a leader or officer,

176
00:08:39.462 --> 00:08:40.192
the responsibility

177
00:08:40.192 --> 00:08:41.692
to motivate and encourage

178
00:08:41.692 --> 00:08:44.692
others is yours.

179
00:08:45.385 --> 00:08:48.346
So, do you feel

180
00:08:48.346 --> 00:08:51.346
that you or your leadership

181
00:08:51.769 --> 00:08:54.769
is the main cause of inspiration

182
00:08:55.115 --> 00:08:58.115
for colleagues' good performance?

183
00:08:58.615 --> 00:08:59.500
Is this why

184
00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.500
you impose your thoughts and wishes on all?

185
00:09:03.462 --> 00:09:05.769
The truth is that

186
00:09:07.115 --> 00:09:08.115
genuine

187
00:09:08.115 --> 00:09:11.808
and lasting motivation comes not from outside, but

188
00:09:13.231 --> 00:09:15.538
from within.

189
00:09:15.538 --> 00:09:18.538
That is, according to each person's own interest,

190
00:09:19.115 --> 00:09:22.115
nature or disposition.

191
00:09:23.423 --> 00:09:25.462
You can certainly

192
00:09:25.462 --> 00:09:27.462
guide colleagues,

193
00:09:27.462 --> 00:09:30.000
influence them too,

194
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.654
but

195
00:09:31.654 --> 00:09:35.538
you cannot compel anyone to work against their basic nature

196
00:09:35.808 --> 00:09:36.885
for a

197
00:09:36.885 --> 00:09:40.462
long time.

198
00:09:41.423 --> 00:09:44.423
Lasting motivation is never possible

199
00:09:45.115 --> 00:09:48.154
by imposing your wishes on others.

200
00:09:49.308 --> 00:09:52.308
Everyone enjoys doing work connected to their interests,

201
00:09:52.462 --> 00:09:54.692
and thus

202
00:09:54.692 --> 00:09:57.692
are motivated.

203
00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.885
What’s your job here?

204
00:09:59.885 --> 00:10:01.500
Your job is

205
00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.192
to connect each person's work

206
00:10:04.192 --> 00:10:07.038
with that person's nature

207
00:10:07.038 --> 00:10:09.000
and basic disposition.

208
00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.000
From tasks done according to

209
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.077
their natural talents and nature,

210
00:10:14.385 --> 00:10:16.692
every colleague will find motivation

211
00:10:16.692 --> 00:10:18.462
within themselves.

212
00:10:19.615 --> 00:10:20.308
You

213
00:10:20.308 --> 00:10:20.808
don't

214
00:10:20.808 --> 00:10:23.885
need to be the main source of motivation.

215
00:10:24.885 --> 00:10:27.885
You just need to be a facilitator

216
00:10:28.231 --> 00:10:29.115
so

217
00:10:29.115 --> 00:10:30.000
everyone

218
00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.000
can access their inner motivation.

219
00:10:33.769 --> 00:10:37.731
This itself will be considered skilled leadership.